---
/**
 * Terms of Service.
 *
 * WHY THIS PAGE EXISTS. It was live on the legacy site at this exact path,
 * linked from every footer, and the rebuild had no equivalent — so the cutover
 * would have 404'd a page that carries the company's estimate, scheduling,
 * payment and guarantee terms. The operator supplied the URL on 22 Sep 2026.
 *
 * THE WORDING IS THE CLIENT'S, NOT OURS. Section 6 is the source of the
 * guarantee wording in business.ts and on /our-guarantee/. A warranty that gets
 * paraphrased is a warranty that gets changed, so the substance here is
 * reproduced from the published terms rather than rewritten. Only the headings
 * and ordering are ours.
 *
 * Source: King of Kings Window Cleaning LLC Terms of Service, last updated
 * 5 August 2026. Re-check this page against the client's own copy whenever they
 * revise it — a stale terms page is worse than no terms page.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BUSINESS } from '../data/business';
import { buildTitle } from '../lib/seo';

export const prerender = true;
/** The date the CLIENT last revised the terms, not the date we last touched this file. */
const termsUpdated = '5 August 2026';

const schema = {
  path: '/terms-of-service/',
  title: buildTitle('Terms of Service'),
  description: 'The terms King of Kings Window Cleaning works under — estimates, scheduling, payment, the satisfaction guarantee and what it excludes.',
  image: '/brand/king-of-kings-social.jpg',
  imageAlt: 'Terms of service for King of Kings Window Cleaning',
  crumbs: [{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Terms of service', path: '/terms-of-service/' }],
  faqs: [],
};
---
<BaseLayout schema={schema}>
  <article class="t1 prose">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {termsUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      By using this website, requesting an estimate, scheduling services or
      communicating with us, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree with
      them, please do not use the website or the services.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Company</h2>
    <p>
      {BUSINESS.legalName} provides residential and commercial exterior cleaning,
      including window cleaning, gutter cleaning, roof debris removal, roof moss
      removal and prevention, pressure washing, house washing and solar panel
      cleaning. Availability varies with location, weather and scheduling.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Estimates</h2>
    <p>
      Every estimate given through this website, by phone, by text or by email is
      an estimate. Final pricing can change with property size, access, the degree
      of cleaning required, safety considerations, additional requested services,
      and conditions that could not reasonably be identified before the visit. A
      final price may be confirmed on arrival where that is necessary.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Scheduling</h2>
    <p>
      Appointments are booked subject to availability. We may need to reschedule
      for weather, unsafe working conditions, equipment problems, emergencies or
      other circumstances outside our control, and we will contact you as soon as
      we know.
    </p>

    <h2>4. What we need from you</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Safe access to the property.</li>
      <li>Pets secured during the service.</li>
      <li>Fragile or valuable items moved out of the work areas.</li>
      <li>Water and electrical access where the work reasonably requires it.</li>
      <li>Any known hazards or property concerns told to us before we start.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Where safe access cannot be provided, the visit may have to be rescheduled.</p>

    <h2>5. Payment</h2>
    <p>
      Payment is due on completion unless something else has been arranged in
      advance. We accept the payment methods listed at the time of service. Late
      payment may be subject to collection efforts where the law permits.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Satisfaction guarantee</h2>
    <p>
      If you are not satisfied with the quality of our work, contact us within
      <strong>7 days</strong> of your service. We will inspect the concern and,
      where appropriate, return to address issues related to the original scope of
      work at no additional charge.
    </p>
    <p>The guarantee does not cover:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>New dirt, pollen, dust or debris that accumulates after service.</li>
      <li>Weather-related spotting after service.</li>
      <li>
        Existing damage, failed window seals, scratches, hard water staining,
        oxidation, mineral deposits or defective glass.
      </li>
      <li>Conditions outside the original scope of work.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The same terms are set out, with the reasoning behind the exclusions, on
      <a href="/our-guarantee/">our guarantee page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Pre-existing conditions</h2>
    <p>
      We use professional equipment and industry-accepted methods, and we are not
      responsible for conditions that were already there: scratched or damaged
      glass, failed window seals, oxidised frames, existing roof damage, loose
      gutters, aging caulking, deteriorated paint, existing leaks or manufacturing
      defects. Where we notice something before or during the work we will point
      it out, and photograph it if you want a record.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Information on this website</h2>
    <p>
      We keep this site accurate, but pricing, services, promotions and
      availability can change without notice. Nothing here is a binding quote or a
      guarantee of a particular result.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The text, logos, graphics, photographs and video on this website are the
      property of {BUSINESS.legalName} unless stated otherwise, and may not be
      copied, reproduced or distributed without written permission.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to other websites from time to time. We are not responsible
      for their content, policies or practices.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, {BUSINESS.legalName} is not liable
      for indirect, incidental, consequential or special damages arising from the
      use of this website or our services, and our total liability will not exceed
      the amount paid for the specific service the claim arises from.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Weather and safety</h2>
    <p>
      Exterior cleaning depends on safe conditions. We may postpone or stop work
      for rain, high wind, lightning, freezing temperatures, unsafe roof
      conditions or anything else that puts the crew or the quality of the work at
      risk, and we will reschedule at the earliest reasonable opportunity.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms. Changes take effect when they are posted here,
      and continued use of the website or our services means you accept them.
    </p>

    <h2>14. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      {BUSINESS.legalName}, Bellingham, WA — serving Whatcom County, Skagit County
      and Oak Harbor.<br />
      Phone: <a href={`tel:${BUSINESS.phoneE164}`}>{BUSINESS.phone}</a><br />
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS.email}`}>{BUSINESS.email}</a>
    </p>
    <p>See also our <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
